WEBVTT

00:02:59.592 --> 00:03:01.344
sheds a little bit of light on this.

00:03:01.594 --> 00:03:05.139
Silvia Bellezza and her colleagues
have done interesting research

00:03:05.139 --> 00:03:07.141
into the fact that in some cultures --

00:03:07.141 --> 00:03:09.435
American culture chief among them --

00:03:09.435 --> 00:03:12.688
busyness is actually a form of status.

00:03:12.939 --> 00:03:17.652
When we say, “Oh, I am so crazy busy,”

00:03:17.652 --> 00:03:19.403
what we’re really saying

00:03:19.403 --> 00:03:24.867
is a societally-accepted version
of “I am so important --

00:03:24.867 --> 00:03:25.868
(Laughter)

00:03:25.868 --> 00:03:27.078
“I am so popular!

00:03:27.078 --> 00:03:28.579
I am so in demand!”

00:03:29.455 --> 00:03:35.670
And the truth is that feeling
can be hard to give up ...